      "title": "Thuat toan Can doi Bu tru Cheo",
      "items": [
        "He thong tham so cot loi: A, B, C, a, b, c, m, n, o",
        "Bu Giang day sang NCKH: m -> c (khi c >= 25% C) cho den khi c_sau = C",
        "Bu NCKH sang Giang day: o -> a cho den khi a_sau = A",
        "Xet gio vuot n = max(0, b - B), thanh toan theo don gia quy dinh"
